pattern                subject       python  perl   node   ruby   java
a+a                    aa            yes     yes    yes    yes    yes
a++a                   aa            no      no     -      no     no
(?>a+)a                aa            no      no     -      no     no
a++b                   aab           yes     yes    -      yes    yes
(?>a+)b                aab           yes     yes    -      yes    yes
^[\w.]+\.com$          example.com   yes     yes    yes    yes    yes
^[\w.]++\.com$         example.com   no      no     -      no     no
(?=(a+))\1a            aa            no      no     no     no     no
(?=(a+))\1b            aab           yes     yes    yes    yes    yes
